  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/en/questions\">Home</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/en/question_categories/selling\">Selling</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>Can I cancel my listing during an ongoing auction?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">Can I cancel my listing during an ongoing auction?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p><span style=\"font-size: var(--text-sm);\">Once you have approved your ad and it is published, it cannot be withdrawn. If you cancel a live auction anyway, <b>you will be charged the buyer fee</b> (based on your reservation price) according to our terms and conditions. The seller fee (2,995 SEK) <b>is non-refundable</b> as the services (valuation, ad production, photography and marketing) have already been delivered.&nbsp;</span>More about this in our <a href=\"/en/docs/terms_and_conditions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">terms and conditions</a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Categories</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/en/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">All</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Buying</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Selling</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bidding</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Documentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Account</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Payments</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Shipping</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verification</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Other questions?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">You can send us an email. We'll be happy to help!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/en\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa 